title    Dorian
about    Just keys and a snap. One chord, Ebm9: the left hand walks Eb F Gb up to Bb, the right hand rests on the chord, then climbs it and turns round and round the F at the top. From a Hooktheory sketch.
key      Ebm
tags     nkgta wip
tempo    88
beats    4
steps    4
swing    0.12
reverb   0.3

voice rh    rhodes  vol=0.65 pan=0.1 bright=0.6 rev=0.35
voice lh    rhodes  vol=0.45 pan=-0.1 bright=0.5 rev=0.25
voice snap  clap    vol=0.5  rev=0.2

# The left hand: Eb F Gb up to a long Bb, every bar the same start, a different
# answer at the end. All of it lives inside Ebm9: Eb Gb Bb Db F.
pattern R1
lh   | Eb3-- F3 Gb3- Bb3------- .. | Eb3-- F3 Gb3- Bb3- F4--- Db4--- | Eb3-- F3 Gb3- Bb3------- Db3- | Eb3-- F3 Gb3- Bb3- Db4--- Db4--- |
rh   | .. Gb4+Bb4+Db5+F5------------- | % | % | % |
snap | .... x... .... x... | % | % | % |

pattern R2 from R1
lh@4 | Eb3-- F3 Gb3- Bb3- Db4--- .... |

# The right hand climbs the chord, Gb Bb Db, to a long F, then Ab Gb F, Ab Gb F,
# while the left hand holds Eb and drops to Db for two beats.
pattern L1 from R1
lh   | Eb2+Bb2--------------- | -------- Db2+Ab2------- | Eb2+Bb2--------------- | % |
rh   | _ | .... Gb4--- Bb4--- Db5--- | F5--------- Ab5 Gb5 F5--- | Ab5 Gb5 F5--- Ab5 Gb5 F5------- |

pattern L2 from L1
rh   | F4--------------- | ---- Gb4--- Bb4--- Db5--- | F5--------- Ab5 Gb5 F5--- | Ab5 Gb5 F5--- Ab5 Gb5 F5------- |

pattern intro from R1
mute snap

play intro
loop R1 R2 L1 L2
